                      "text": [
                        {
                          "locale": "en",
                          "text": "This screen shows an example of how oversized content is handled in different repeat overview tables with infinite scrolling.\n<br/>\nIf the content does not fit in the given row height, the content is cut off and three points are displayed at the end.\n<br/>\nMulti-select values are furthermore displayed as a comma-separated list instead of a bullet point list."
